</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s14"></div><div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:720; height:540; background-color:#ffffff;"><div class="s2"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"> </p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B64C3068-7B51-48F3-8B77-632AA161E24D/x-apple-ql-magic/F3D9DA68-39B6-479D-A4CA-617891241C26.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-14; left:-15; width:749; height:567;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:72; width:612; height:90;"><div class="s16"><div class="s15"><p class="s17"><span class="s56">III. </span><span class="s31">Патофизиологическая стадия</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:114; left:72; width:612; height:360;"><div class="s7"><p class="s18"><span class="s21">(стадия клинических проявлений): </span></p><p class="s61"><span class="s21">влияние биологически активных веществ</span></p><p class="s61"><span class="s21">→ нарушение функционирования клеток и тканей организма вплоть до их повреждения </span></p></div></div></div><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://22B4E2FB-CBEE-4CF8-B68E-22A0CF395BA2/x-apple-ql-magic/341DDC64-ABC3-4E07-BF9D-62B9FD5E7811.jpg" class="s0"><div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:720; height:540; background-color:#ffffff;"><div class="s2"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"> </p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://01E529B5-CB5D-4453-B882-4F612DE13844/x-apple-ql-magic/D8794566-8E75-4505-B95B-5F010A52896E.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-14; left:-14; width:749; height:566;"><div style="position:absolute; top:114; left:5; width:710; height:120; background-color:#d34817;"><div class="s4"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"> </p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:110; left:5; width:710; height:9; background-color:#e6b1ab;"><div class="s5"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"> </p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:234; left:5; width:710; height:8; background-color:#918485;">