;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://D49478D5-D812-4AF2-A54E-1EF5494D0933/x-apple-ql-magic/B14A48CD-B63A-4C7A-89EF-2E8570DF00A2.jpg" style="position:absolute; top:116; left:399; width:294; height:174;"></div><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s14"></div><div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:720; height:540; background-color:#ffffff;"><div class="s2"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"> </p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://B64C3068-7B51-48F3-8B77-632AA161E24D/x-apple-ql-magic/F3D9DA68-39B6-479D-A4CA-617891241C26.pdf" style="position:absolute; top:-14; left:-15; width:749; height:567;"><div style="position:absolute; top:21; left:72; width:612; height:90;"><div class="s16"><div class="s15"><p class="s17"><span class="s31">Ринит, конъюктивит, крапивница</span></p></div></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://F30F76C2-9CB7-4AFD-BE73-54CDF8DDD34B/x-apple-ql-magic/0D811568-7E20-4AF4-92A9-9E168DCE5A17.png" style="position:absolute; top:232; left:119; width:199; height:123;"><img src="x-apple-ql-id://CCA1A94E-C8B2-4FF1-8D68-4709698BE717/x-apple-ql-magic/B1BCF8BA-E908-4F3C-8CA8-27C02DF82360.png" style="position:absolute; top:122; left:25; width:413; height:306;"></div><style type="text/css">
